@startuml User_Chatbot_SSD

actor "User\n(Tourist/Guest)" as User
participant "UI: Chatbot" as UI
participant "Database" as DB
participant "OpenAI API" as OpenAI

== Access Chatbot ==

User -> UI: Click floating chatbot icon\n(Juan character)
activate UI

UI -> UI: Load chat history\n(from localStorage if within 3 days)

UI -> DB: Fetch chatbot knowledge base
activate DB
DB --> UI: Return knowledge entries
deactivate DB

UI --> User: Display chat interface with history
deactivate UI

== Send Text Message ==

User -> UI: Type message and click send
activate UI

UI -> UI: Add user message to chat

UI --> User: Display user message

UI -> UI: Show "typing..." indicator

UI -> OpenAI: Send message with:\n- User input\n- Knowledge base context\n- Chat history
activate OpenAI
OpenAI --> UI: Return AI response
deactivate OpenAI

UI -> UI: Add bot response to chat

UI -> UI: Save chat to localStorage\n(with 3-day expiry timestamp)

UI --> User: Display bot response
deactivate UI

== Voice Input ==

User -> UI: Click microphone icon
activate UI

UI -> UI: Start speech recognition

UI --> User: Show "Listening..." indicator

User -> UI: Speak message

UI -> UI: Convert speech to text

UI --> User: Display recognized text in input

User -> UI: Click send

UI -> OpenAI: Send recognized text
activate OpenAI
OpenAI --> UI: Return AI response
deactivate OpenAI

UI --> User: Display bot response
deactivate UI

== Text-to-Speech ==

User -> UI: Toggle TTS on
activate UI

UI --> User: Enable TTS indicator

UI -> UI: Automatically speak new bot messages

UI --> User: Play audio of bot response
deactivate UI

User -> UI: Click speaker icon on message
activate UI

UI -> UI: Speak selected message

UI --> User: Play audio
deactivate UI

== Drag Chatbot Icon ==

User -> UI: Drag floating chatbot icon
activate UI

UI -> UI: Update icon position

UI -> UI: Snap to edge when released

UI --> User: Display icon at new position
deactivate UI

== Close Chatbot ==

User -> UI: Click X or outside chatbot
activate UI

UI -> UI: Save current chat to localStorage

UI --> User: Close chat interface,\nshow floating icon
deactivate UI

== Clear Chat History ==

User -> UI: Chat history expires (3 days)
activate UI

UI -> UI: Clear localStorage:\n- Messages\n- Timestamps

UI --> User: Fresh chat on next open
deactivate UI

note right of User
  **Chatbot Features:**
  • Floating draggable icon (Juan character)
  • Text and voice input
  • Text-to-speech output
  • Chat history saved (3 days)
  • Knowledge base from admin entries
  • OpenAI GPT integration
  • Works for both Tourists and Guests
end note

@enduml
